OL,3,AIs a September heatwave forecast for
OL,4,Athe UK?
OL,5,
OL,6,FComputer weather models paint a very
OL,7,Fmixed picture for the second half of
OL,8,FSeptember but, while there are likely
OL,9,Fto be some warm spells, there are
OL,10,Fcurrently no definitive signs of a
OL,11,Fheatwave.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
